# The Hayes St Hill Bomb (run bomb hayes): from Pierce at Alamo Square (68 m) east down Hayes past
# Steiner, Fillmore, Webster, Buchanan and Laguna to Octavia (10 m), 10% for the first three blocks.
# The route has no rider line, so its locals follow its start and gates. Pushed off straight and
# tucked all the way (no steering needed: the street runs at heading 81), the player tops out at
# 17.6 m/s past Fillmore, just under the tuck's wobble speed, and is home first in 57.48 s (57.49 before
# the squeezed city, 57.43 before city phase 11), 0.3 s
# ahead of the Painted Ladies landlord (the barista is 60.53, the tour guide 65.31 when they finish):
# Hayes Under a Minute and Beat the Landlord.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb hayes
hold up 10..300
hold ollie 300..9000
run 7300
expect event bombReady{route=hayes,name=Hayes St,gates=7} within 0..2
expect event bombStart{route=hayes,gate=Start} within 265..269
expect event bombCheckpoint{route=hayes,n=1,gate=Hayes & Steiner} within 1242..1246
expect event bombCheckpoint{route=hayes,n=2,gate=Hayes & Fillmore} within 2439..2443
expect event bombCheckpoint{route=hayes,n=3,gate=Hayes & Webster} within 3491..3495
expect event bombCheckpoint{route=hayes,n=4,gate=Hayes & Buchanan} within 4557..4561
expect event bombCheckpoint{route=hayes,n=5,gate=Hayes & Laguna} within 5712..5716
expect event bombFinish{route=hayes,time=57.48,falls=0,braked=false,place=1,of=4} within 7164..7168
expect event goalComplete{id=hayes60,name=Hayes Under a Minute,area=Hayes Valley} within 7164..7168
expect event goalComplete{id=hayeswin,name=Beat the Landlord} within 7164..7168
expect no event racerFinish
expect no event bail
